{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b8820e03-e870-8e4e-abfc-1d61499f6771",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T13:32:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance, this is Luis. Happy almost New Year. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Yes, my name is Dario Fortes. I am calling about the property tax, please. I am a renter, but my landlord has asked me to help with some papers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can try. What do you need?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, first, I would like to ask about the assessment appeal. Is there a deadline for this? How do I know when it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a deadline, yes, and it's firm. What's the address on the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 112 Kay Street. In the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:29:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 112 Kay. Is the landlord the one who wants to appeal, or are you thinking about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The landlord, he is thinking. He says the number is too high. Me, I only want to know the date, so I can tell him. Como se diz... how do you say, so he does not lose the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. The appeal window runs from when the assessment notices go out, and it's a limited number of days after the tax bill is issued. Let me pull up the parcel so I give you the right date for this one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. I'm seeing the appeal has to be filed in writing with the tax assessor's office, and I don't have a date in front of me that I want to read to you from this screen. The assessor's office can confirm it exactly. I can transfer you, or I can have them call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back is good. Is it okay if I give the number of my cell phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0182. The name is Dario Fortes. F-O-R-T-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182, Fortes. I'll put a note in that it's about the appeal deadline for 112 Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And the second thing. My landlord, he needs a duplicate bill. He did not receive the last one, or maybe it was lost in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. Do you want it mailed to the same address on the account, or somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The same one is fine. He picks up the mail there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm requesting a duplicate to the address on file. It should go out in the next few days, so give it a week with the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. Good. I will tell him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You sound like you're outside. Wind's picking up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:32:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am walking now. I just joined a walking group, it meets at dawn. Very early. Today I walk again for the afternoon, to keep the habit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dawn in December. That's commitment. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:32:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. You have been very helpful. Thank you, Mr. Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. The assessor's office will call you, and the bill's in the mail. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Good afternoon."
    }
  ],
